    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's more than just feeling lost. It's like the story is done. You know how a book ends? You reach the last page, the ink runs dry, and you just... close it. There's no point in keeping the pages turning if there's nothing left to read. Even the sword at my side, it feels more like a companion than a weapon now. It's the only thing that doesn't demand anything more from me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
